The *.patch files here are unified diffs against stock Amix 2.1 kernel sources
(paths relative to /usr/sys). The context lines a patch quotes from a stock file
remain under their original Commodore/AT&T SVR4 copyright; kernel/k30's MIT
license covers only the added and changed lines and the explanatory text.
The stock files themselves are not in this repository: they are the AMIX_SYSTEM
input (amigaux/amix-system, usr/sys).
